<title>USA: Hastings Manufacturing Co Q4 loss widens.</title>
<headline>Hastings Manufacturing Co Q4 loss widens.</headline>
<dateline>HASTINGS, Mich. 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr	 loss	   $1.85     loss	 $1.40</p>
<p> Net	 loss	     720     loss	   543</p>
<p> Revs			 8,146		   10,770</p>
<p>NOTE: Q4 1996 results include a non-recurring charge of $351,500 for restructuring.</p>
<p>	  12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr	 loss	   $2.27     loss	 $7.78</p>
<p> Net	 loss	     885     loss	 3,023</p>
<p> Revs			39,409		   63,228</p>
<p>NOTE: 1996 results include $819,900 in special pre-tax charges for restructuring and relocation costs following the company's September 1995 sale of its filter unit.</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
